    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4 The View, Gleann Na Rí, Tower is a well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac in the heart of Tower. Offering three bedrooms and one bathroom, the property represents a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers or those looking for a comfortable starter home, with the added benefit of pleasant countryside views to the front.\r\n\r\nThe location offers the perfect balance of village living and convenience, with Tower’s local amenities close at hand, while Ballincollig is approximately 15 minutes away and Cork City is approximately 20 minutes away by car. With its attractive setting, practical accommodation and convenient location, No. 4 is a lovely home with plenty to offer its next owners.\r\n \r\nAgent: Mark Walsh      Email: mark.walsh@omw.ie \r\nMobile: 0873493066"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway 1.80 x 4.31 m\r\nBright and welcoming entrance hallway with timbe flooring, carpeted staircase, under stairs storage perfect for shoes and coats. \r\n\r\nLiving Room      2.82 x 4.32 m\r\nBright and spacious living room featuring timber flooring, an attractive open fireplace with, decorative coving and large windows providing plenty of natural light.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen & Dining 4.70 x 7.92 m\r\nBright and spacious open-plan area combining fitted kitchen with comfortable dining spaces. Side Door & sliding rear doors provide direct access to the rear garden, allowing plenty of natural light into this excellent family living space.\r\n\r\nStairs & Landing    2.03 x 3.12 m\r\nCarpeted stairs landing, side window & entry to all bedrooms & family bathroom.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom     2.60 x 3.45 m\r\nBright and spacious double bedroom featuring timber flooring, generous, fitted timber wardrobes providing excellent storage, and large windows allowing plenty of natural light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2      2.59 x 3.66 m\r\nSpacious double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and a rear aspect window that provides plenty of light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3       2.34 x 2.61 m\r\nBedroom with a rear aspect window. \r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom       2.03 x 2.43 m\r\n3-piece suite, electric shower, with mirror and a front aspect window. \r\n\r\nGarden Details\r\n\r\nFront: laid mainly to lawn, with a concrete driveway providing off-street parking and mature shrubs adding a touch of greenery. Gated side access leads through to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nRear Garden: Laid mainly to lawn and offers an ideal space for outdoor enjoyment, complete with a timber garden shed and outdoor pizza oven – perfect for entertaining family and friends. Convenient side access leads to the front of the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large open plan kitchen and dining room.\r\nPerfect starter home.\r\nLocated in tower village.\r\nAdjacent to a green area.\r\nQuiet Cul De Sac\r\nPerfect Starter Home\r\nPrime location"
      },
      {
